                %strong Sketches of an Elephant – A Topos Theory Compendium
              %p
                %br/
              %p Oxford University Press (2002)
              %p
                Volume 1:
                %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/sketches-of-an-elephant-9780198534259"} ISBN:9780198534259
                562 pages
              %p
